## Integration

| Route | Auth |
|-------|------|
| `/api/integration/hotel-lifecycle` | bridge secret — check-in/out, room change, **stay product changed** |
| `/api/integration/staff-provision` | bridge secret |
| `/api/integration/settlement-confirmed` | bridge secret — hotel Front Cash paid callback |
| `/api/billing/context` | session — `deferWalkInToHub` for cashier gate |
| `/api/procedures/confirm` | session **DOCTOR** (+ admin) — confirm `PROPOSED` → `placeConfirmedProcedures` FIFO |
| `/api/procedures/bulk-cancel` | session **RECEPTION** (+ admin) — bulk cancel + optional replace code |
| `PATCH /api/procedures/[id]` | session **DOCTOR** / **RECEPTION** (+ admin) — PROPOSED/SCHEDULED: `siteIds[]`, `siteApplyMode` (TURN/TOGETHER), `note`, legacy `bodyPart` (derived from sites when `siteIds` sent) |
| `/api/procedures/[id]/reschedule` | session **RECEPTION** (+ admin) — matrix slot move (`resourceId` optional) |
| `/api/procedures/[id]/cancel` | session **RECEPTION** |
| `/api/procedures/[id]/check-in` | session NURSE — QR / MANUAL (`checkInRequiresQr=false`) / override; channel-aware window; **atomic → `CHECKED_IN`** (no auto-complete) |
| `/api/procedures/[id]/start` | alias of check-in |
| `/api/procedures/[id]/complete` | session NURSE — stuck `CHECKED_IN` fallback only (happy path = auto by `endsAt`) |
| `/api/nurse/qr-scan` | session NURSE — verifyGuestQrToken; returns `qrToken` for check-in |
| `/api/cron/procedure-auto-complete` | Bearer `PLATFORM_CRON_SECRET` — `CHECKED_IN` past `endsAt` → `COMPLETED`; Wave 4 `byOrganization` |
| Procedure TTK → Finance (CLI-47) | **API** — `ProcedureConsumableLine`; `GET/PUT …/procedure-types/[id]/consumables`; `GET /api/admin/finance-products`; complete resolves BOM (no `PROC-*`, no retail HTTP); Finance write-off W2 |
| `/api/cron/procedure-no-show-sweep` | Bearer `PLATFORM_CRON_SECRET` — stale `SCHEDULED` → `NO_SHOW` (burns quota); Wave 4 `byOrganization` |
| `/api/procedures/[id]/no-show` | session NURSE — burns quota + may charge folio |
| `/api/sanatorium/resources/available-slots` | session RECEPTION — free inventory (exhausted omitted) |
| `/api/capacity/summary` | bridge secret — GET remaining%/risk (`x-era-organization-id` or process bind); POST `runCronForEachTenant` → `byOrganization` |

