## ICD-10 catalog (CLI-39…42)

Global WHO ICD-10 (2019) table `IcdCode` — **no** `organizationId`. Search `GET /api/icd` (selectable CATEGORY/LEAF only; not `/api/icd10`). ADR: [clinic-icd10-catalog.md](../../../docs/adr/clinic-icd10-catalog.md). Optional sync from orchestrator `GET /platform/v1/catalog/icd10` (in-process generator, not data-hub).
